  "description": "Drome’s flip-flop hub allows you to choose between freewheel and single-speed to match your riding style. The smooth welded frame, lightweight and extremely durable carbon fiber fork, integrated headset, front and rear brakes, and sealed bearing hubs prepare you for a wild ride on your own terms. Drome’s fewer parts mean less maintenance on your bike overall.\n\nBuilt for Speed\nA sharp, slick diamond frame captures an urban edge, slices through wind, cuts through streets, and expertly handles its way around the track.\n\nThis, That, and a Little Extra\nDrome’s flip-flop hub allows you to choose between freewheel and single-speed to match your riding style. The smooth welded frame, lightweight and extremely durable carbon fiber fork, integrated headset, front and rear brakes, and sealed bearing hubs prepare you for a wild ride on your own terms.\n\nLightweight Carbon Fork\nDrome's lightweight Carbon Fiber, 1.5\" Taper (1 1/8\"/28.6mm x 1 1/2\"/39.8mm) fork is as durable as it is sleek.\n\n*We strongly suggest that you take your bike to a professional bicycle mechanic to be built and/or checked out to ensure that the cog and lockring are tightened, the brakes adjusted, and the wheels trued.",
